# HTML Lists and Tables 📚

Today, I learned about HTML Lists and Tables.

## Topics Covered

* Ordered List (`<ol>`)
* Unordered List (`<ul>`)
* Description List (`<dl>`)
* Table (`<table>`)
* Table Row (`<tr>`)
* Table Header (`<th>`)
* Table Data (`<td>`)
* `colspan` and `rowspan`

🚀 Continuing my HTML learning journey!
